"""Type stubs for the `_hypergraph_rs_core` PyO3 extension module.

Hand-written (maturin does not auto-generate `.pyi` from PyO3 without
`pyo3-stub-gen`, which is not in the pin set — spec §6.5, Task 14). Covers
every `#[pyclass]` and `#[pyfunction]` actually compiled into the extension
(`crates/hypergraph-rs-python/src/*.rs`) — the pure-Python deferred-symbol
shims in `hypergraph_rs/_deferred.py` and friends are plain `.py` modules
already covered by `py.typed` and need no stub here.

Node/edge ids are arbitrary Python hashables (`PyId` translation layer,
Task 2) — `Hashable` throughout, never `str`/`int`.
"""

from typing import Any, Hashable, Iterable, Iterator

